+issueNumber: MDL-88604
+notes:
+  core_courseformat:
+    - message: >-
+        The `core_courseformat/local/linearnavigation/footer_content` template
+        now receives `isfirst`, `islast` and `courseurl` context variables. The
+        `previousurl` is null for the first activity of the course (the
+        "Previous" link is hidden) and the `nexturl` is null for the last
+        activity of the course, where a "Go to course" link pointing to
+        `courseurl` is displayed instead. The
+        `\core_courseformat\output\local\linearnavigation\footer_content` class
+        has new `is_first_activity()` and `is_last_activity()` public methods.
+      type: changed
